{"id":10475,"date":"2026-04-13T23:22:14","date_gmt":"2026-04-13T23:22:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/?post_type=blogs&#038;p=10475"},"modified":"2026-04-28T23:06:47","modified_gmt":"2026-04-28T23:06:47","slug":"reasons-for-neck-and-shoulder-pain","status":"publish","type":"blogs","link":"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/blogs\/reasons-for-neck-and-shoulder-pain\/","title":{"rendered":"Top Reasons for Neck and Shoulder Pain &#8211; Dr. Usama Saleh"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"10475\" class=\"elementor elementor-10475\" data-elementor-post-type=\"blogs\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-42fd22f1 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"42fd22f1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-78f0cab1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"78f0cab1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you are reading this, perhaps you woke up today feeling a heavy tightness across your shoulders, or maybe a sharp, nagging ache in your neck made it difficult to drive your children to school or focus on your work here in Dubai. You might now be wondering what are the reasons for neck and shoulder pain I&#8217;m experiencing. I want you to know one thing immediately: <\/span>You are not alone, and you are in the right place.<\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In my years as an orthopedic specialist, I have sat across from thousands of neighbors, friends, and patients who felt frustrated by persistent discomfort. My philosophy at the <\/span><b>Dr. Usama Saleh<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> clinic is simple: <\/span>You are family.<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> I don\u2019t just see a case of cervicalgia; I see a person who wants to get back to their active life, their family gatherings, and their professional goals without being held back by pain.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Understanding the <\/span>reasons for neck and shoulder pain<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is the first step toward reclaiming your well-being. The neck and shoulders are more than just bone and muscle; they are the bridge between your mind and your body. When that bridge is under stress, your whole quality of life can feel the impact.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c86ce4a e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"c86ce4a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3612c3d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3612c3d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Common reasons for neck and shoulder pain.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45f1e12f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"45f1e12f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The human head weighs about 5 kilograms. roughly the weight of a heavy bowling ball. Your neck, or the <\/span>cervical spine<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, is responsible for balancing that weight while allowing you to rotate, tilt, and look at the world around you. Because the nerves that travel to your arms and shoulders originate in your neck, it is very common for a problem in one area to be felt in the other.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7c44cf2f elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"7c44cf2f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">1. The Modern Tech-Neck and Physical Strain<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-348783dd elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"348783dd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">One of the most frequent <\/span>reasons for neck and shoulder pain<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> I see in my Dubai practice is related to our modern lifestyle. Whether you are an executive in DIFC hunched over a laptop for ten hours a day or someone constantly looking down at a smartphone, your neck muscles are working overtime. This &#8220;forward head posture&#8221; strains the ligaments and creates a persistent, dull ache that eventually radiates into the shoulder blades.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-51f88a1a elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"51f88a1a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">2. The Natural Process of Aging (Wear and Tear)<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-229457b4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"229457b4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As we get older, our bodies change. just like a well-loved home that needs a little extra maintenance.<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Osteoarthritis:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> The smooth cartilage between your joints can wear down over time, leading to stiffness.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Degenerative Disk Disease:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> The cushions (disks) between your vertebrae lose water as you age, bringing the bones closer together and causing irritation.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Bone Spurs:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Sometimes, the body tries to heal itself by growing extra bone, which can unfortunately press on sensitive nerves.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-752798b0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"752798b0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">3. Injuries and Whiplash<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-25135d17 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"25135d17\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Dubai is a city on the move, and unfortunately, minor traffic accidents or sports injuries (like a fall during a weekend football match or a sudden jerk during Padel) can cause <\/span>whiplash<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. This occurs when the head is snapped forward and back, overstretching the soft tissues.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44c208a elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"44c208a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"435\" src=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/causes-of-neck-and-shoulder-pain-1024x557.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-10403\" alt=\"causes of neck and shoulder pain\" srcset=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/causes-of-neck-and-shoulder-pain-1024x557.webp 1024w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/causes-of-neck-and-shoulder-pain-300x163.webp 300w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/causes-of-neck-and-shoulder-pain-768x418.webp 768w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/causes-of-neck-and-shoulder-pain-600x326.webp 600w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/causes-of-neck-and-shoulder-pain.webp 1316w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7547b1b0 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"7547b1b0\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5d723656 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"5d723656\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Recognizing the Symptoms: What Is Your Body Telling You?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-30518393 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"30518393\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When we meet in my office, I will ask you to describe your pain as if you were talking to a brother. Is it a zap, a burn, or a heavy weight? Recognizing these symptoms helps us narrow down the <\/span>reasons for neck and shoulder pain<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> specific to your body.<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Axial Pain:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> This is felt primarily in the neck itself. It might feel like a kink that makes it hard to turn your head to check your blind spot while driving.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Radicular Pain:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> This is the shooting sensation. It travels from the neck, over the shoulder, and sometimes all the way down to the fingers.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Numbness and Tingling:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Often described as pins and needles, this usually suggests that a nerve is being slightly squeezed or pinched.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Muscle Spasms:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Your body\u2019s way of trying to protect an injured area by tightening the muscles into a hard, painful knot.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-583ea3c7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"583ea3c7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Read also: <a href=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/blogs\/shoulder-blade-pain\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">shoulder blade pain treatment with Dr. Usama Saleh<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-301987dc e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"301987dc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4fee33c1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4fee33c1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Dr. Usama\u2019s Diagnostic Pathway: A Compassionate Approach<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9c767f3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"9c767f3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I believe that a good doctor should be a great detective. We don&#8217;t just jump to conclusions; we listen to the clues your body provides.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-584341b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"584341b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Personal Conversation (Medical History)<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-29cb767f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"29cb767f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I want to hear about your daily routine. Do you sit at a desk? Do you carry a heavy laptop bag over one shoulder? Have you had any recent falls? Understanding your lifestyle story is often more revealing than a scan.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-484a5ccc elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"484a5ccc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Gentle Physical Exam<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4e624e43 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4e624e43\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I will observe how you move, check your posture, and feel the muscles of your neck and upper back. I look for trigger points or areas of tenderness that tell me which structures are under duress.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-52c61a0c elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"52c61a0c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Advanced Imaging (Only When Necessary)<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1dbd8b72 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1dbd8b72\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In the spirit of being a responsible doctor, I don\u2019t order tests unless they truly add value to your recovery.<\/span><\/p><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>X-Rays:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> To look at the alignment of your bones and check for signs of arthritis.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>MRI:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> The gold standard for seeing &#8220;soft tissues&#8221; like herniated disks or pinched nerves.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>CT Scans:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Best for looking at bone spurs or complex bone structures.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4cbe5fde elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4cbe5fde\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Visit my official website now &#8211; <a href=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">usamasaleh.com<\/a> &#8211; and discover the medical treatments and services I offer, as well as my clients&#8217; review about these services.<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-61182434 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"61182434\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e8922fc elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e8922fc\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"450\" src=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-diagnosis-1024x576.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-9966\" alt=\"shoulder pain diagnosis\" srcset=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-diagnosis-1024x576.webp 1024w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-diagnosis-300x169.webp 300w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-diagnosis-768x432.webp 768w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-diagnosis.webp 1292w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-31a0e959 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"31a0e959\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Treatment Options for neck and shoulder pain.<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-24788de7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"24788de7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The good news is that most <\/span>reasons for neck and shoulder pain<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> do not require surgery. At the <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/meet-dr-usama\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Dr. Usama Saleh<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> clinic, we prioritize the most gentle, effective treatments first.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2fe696cd elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"2fe696cd\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Conservative and Home Remedies<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2e647862 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2e647862\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Temperature Therapy:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> A warm shower or heating pad can loosen tight muscles, while an ice pack is wonderful for reducing inflammation after a sudden strain.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Ergonomic Adjustments:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> We will talk about your desk setup. Raising your monitor to eye level can be life-changing.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Activity Modification:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Sometimes, the body just needs a &#8220;time-out&#8221; from the activity that caused the strain.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44b3573d elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"44b3573d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Professional Therapy<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a782c8d elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2a782c8d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Physical Therapy:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> I work closely with wonderful therapists who can teach you specific exercises to strengthen your &#8220;back extensor&#8221; muscles, pulling your shoulders back into their natural, healthy position.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Pain Management:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> For persistent inflammation, localized steroid injections or muscle relaxants can provide the &#8220;window of relief&#8221; needed to begin effective physical therapy.<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-75f5d36e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"75f5d36e\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Surgical Intervention<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cecb4f2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cecb4f2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Surgery is rare, but if a nerve is severely compressed or a disk is causing weakness in your arms, we may discuss surgical options. Rest assured, if we reach this stage, I treat the procedure with the same precision and care I would give to my own family members, using minimally invasive techniques whenever possible to ensure a faster journey back home.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-369bc84a elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"369bc84a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Read also: <a href=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/blogs\/shoulder-blade-pain-pregnancy\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">fix shoulder blade pain pregnancy-related conditions, and how pregnancy can cause shoulder pain<\/a>.<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5ccc8542 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5ccc8542\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-66fb2c59 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"66fb2c59\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">The Dubai Context: Lifestyle, Weather, and Wellness<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-eb76049 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"eb76049\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Living in the UAE presents unique challenges for our musculoskeletal health.<\/span><\/p><ol><li><b>The &#8220;AC Effect&#8221;<br \/><\/b>In Dubai, we spend much of our time in heavily air-conditioned environments. Cold air blowing directly on the neck can cause muscles to contract and seize up. I always recommend wearing a light scarf or adjusting the vents in your car so they aren&#8217;t hitting your neck directly.<\/li><li><b>Weekend Warriors<br \/><\/b>Many of our expat families are incredibly active. golf, Padel, and gym culture are huge here. While I love seeing my patients active, a &#8220;weekend warrior&#8221; approach (doing nothing all week and then playing four hours of intense sports) is a major cause of shoulder strains. Consistency is key!<\/li><li><b>The Stress Connection<br \/><\/b>Dubai is a high-performance city. We carry our stress on our shoulders. Mindfulness and breathing exercises aren&#8217;t just for the soul\u2014they literally help relax the muscles that cause tension headaches and neck stiffness.<\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-38f3c979 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"38f3c979\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"444\" src=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-causes-1024x568.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-9988\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-causes-1024x568.webp 1024w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-causes-300x166.webp 300w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-causes-768x426.webp 768w, https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/shoulder-pain-causes.webp 1319w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-53a3fc92 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"53a3fc92\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3d679832 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3d679832\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Preventing Pain Before It Starts<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-115f1247 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"115f1247\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I would much rather see you for a friendly check-up than for an emergency pain visit. <\/span><b>Here is how you can protect yourself:<\/b><\/p><ol><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>The &#8220;Lifting&#8221; Rule:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Never carry a heavy bag on just one shoulder. Switch sides frequently or use a backpack with two straps to distribute the weight.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Hydration:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Your spinal disks are mostly water. In the heat of the UAE, staying hydrated is essential for keeping those &#8220;cushions&#8221; healthy.<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>The 20-20-20 Rule:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> If you work at a computer, every 20 minutes, look 20 feet away for 20 seconds. While you do this, perform a few gentle shoulder rolls.<\/span><\/li><\/ol>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-30ab5844 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"30ab5844\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-389d65f9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"389d65f9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Why Choose Dr. Usama Saleh?<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-253f9702 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"253f9702\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When you look for an orthopedic expert in Dubai, you are looking for someone who combines world-class training with a heart that genuinely cares. My goal is to make sure that from the moment you walk into the clinic, you feel heard, respected, and supported.<\/span><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">I specialize in identifying the underlying <\/span>reasons for neck and shoulder pain<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> so that we aren&#8217;t just masking the problem with pills, but actually healing the source. I believe in transparency; I will always explain your diagnosis in plain, simple language and involve you in every decision about your care.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-779de929 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"779de929\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Now you can browse our <a href=\"https:\/\/usamasaleh.com\/shoulder-treatment-dubai\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">shoulder treatment cases<\/a> in Dubai online.<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-36fbcaf3 elementor-widget elementor-widget-video\" data-id=\"36fbcaf3\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;youtube_url&quot;:&quot;https:\\\/\\\/www.youtube.com\\\/shorts\\\/DBxZrbL8AY4&quot;,&quot;lazy_load&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;,&quot;video_type&quot;:&quot;youtube&quot;,&quot;controls&quot;:&quot;yes&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"video.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-wrapper elementor-open-inline\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-video\"><\/div>\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6bc4d2b7 e-flex e-con-boxed wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no wpr-column-slider-no wpr-equal-height-no e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"6bc4d2b7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t